! Sacramento Court Jury
! Version 1 dwg 12/17/09 - based on SFCJury script same date
!
! 3/23/10 - dwg - bypassed Name Verification, see line 1852 to restore
! 2010-03-24 - RR/DWG Final go live changes for production
! 2 2010-05-21 RR added VM transfers for Shana and Pat, removed operator options from first two levels of menus.
! added jsi disconnect for all calls regardless. Might be overkill. Monitor for problems. RR 20101014! 5 2010-11-03 dwg - added path to turn on speechrec #9999
! 4 2010-08-09 dwg, mostly ASR, not all menus converted.
! 5 2010-11-19 dwg, Production ASR version
! 6 2010-11-23 dwg, Added back VerifyBadgeNumber, convert menu blocks to Recognize blocks:
!                   VerifyBadgeNumber, JurorFTAMenu, PaymentInfoMenu
! 7 2010-11-30 dwg, close speech rec session when DTMF mode chosen from language menu
! 10 2011-3-3  TB added stat event for completed postponements
! 10 2011-3-28 RR Fixed ACD Route on Language menu
! 11 2012-2-17 TB added missing OnResult=Repeat from several menus using the RepeatOrMain.gram
! 12 2012-2-22 TB added missing OnResult=Information to MiddayCallinRecBlock
! 13 2012-6-12 TB corrected FAQMainMenuDTMF; missing OnKey9
! 14 2012-7-31 RR Added admin functions for testing when HostAvailable=0
! 15 2013-5-28 DG Three digit group numbers
!  The JSI Access Module ONLY RETURNS 4 digit group numbers. So Group Numbers
!  retrieved from the database will be 4 digits starting with 0, so 0101, 0110.
!  Callers will only enter 3 digits and we have to prepend a zero.
! 
! 16 2013-8-06 DG Complete script for contract Agreement No 550112-1112.
! 24 2013-10-14 RR Midday callin menu option 2 fixed
! 25 2013-10-14 RR play option 2 fixed
! 26 2013-10-18 RR Added MaintenanceMode (page 5) and new var
! 27/30 20140312 RR Final cleanup for cutover and removed returnmenu option. No longer used.
! 28 2014-0408  TB Fixed ASR group number entry
! 29 2015-11-19 RS Changed ResultLengthMin and ResultLengthMax in GetJurorIDBlock.
! 30 2019-12-27 DG Felon SB310 change, Felon excusal goes to agent
! 31 2020-04-19 DG CVS conversion, first draft
! 32 2021-04-02 TB added routes to Trial Departments
! 33 2022-03-09 EB OnKey0=AcdAvailable back in DTMF path
! 34 2022-04-29 TB added PauseAfterDisconnect and Jury_Initialize so re-retrieval after reschedule doesn't fail
! 35 2022-05-13	DG Spanish language experience changes
! 36 2022-05-27 dg Added DbDown for JSI Db maintenance
! 37 2022-10-05 TB Added Sorry menu to prevent phantom calls to agent
! 38 2022-10-14 dg Updated Utilities stored procedure so that auto-postponements for certain excusals go to Thursdays. 
!                  See note in GetPotentialDeferralDates below
! 39 2023-03-15 TB Removed CallControl Disconnect block to help prevent hung disconnects
! 40 2024-03-22 EB NE_CheckBadgeLength block; verify badge number on 8 and 9 digits, not just 7
! 41 2024-04-02	EB Added Jury_DeferralDaysAway variable; Autopostponement.  SoleSource=30 and Default for Medical is 60 days.
! 42 2024-10-17 RR Initialized Jury_SendNoticeIndicator to 0 instead of null
! 43 2025-10-23 EB Sending CheckForJurorID customer defined routes to HoldMusicForGetJurorRecord instead of ConstructMainMenu to refresh record
! 44 2026-02-07 dg Switching from Oracle to MSSQL - change to ODBC connections.
!                  Updated JSI DLLS JNGPCAPI.DLL v8.2.6.005 2/8/2018
!                  Updated Cobol (yes cobol) dlls in MSSQL/
!                  Updated SonantJsi.Service.ini to use MSSQL dlls
! 45 2026-04-01 EB Added Russian language experience
! 46 2026-06-12 DG Added additional languages, plus some cleanup 
!
[ScriptSetup]
